{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Statutory requirement for schools to show proof of EHCP Section F provision",
        "additional_details": "Where specified provision should have been recorded, but no record exists, we want the absence of evidence to result in the presumption that the provision was not delivered, unless reliable evidence demonstrates otherwise.",
        "background": "Mandate schools and education providers in England to record and show evidence of EHCP Section F provision. We want the Government to require education providers to keep clear, up-to-date written records showing when provision specified in Section F of an EHCP has or hasn\u2019t been delivered, and why.",
